                                "sense_id": "ea887348-530b-345b-a5d9-1e4a9792d191",
                                "text": "“He accused us of slandering him, presumably by implying he was a hipster, and of using the pic without his permission,” Gideon Lichfield, the Review’s editor-in-chief, explained Tuesday on Twitter."
